    {
      "text": "They paralyze prey with poison, then drag them down to their lairs, five miles below the surface.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "If its veil-like arms stun and wrap a foe, that foe will be dragged miles below the surface, never to return.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It wraps its veillike arms and legs around prey swimming by and drags them down to the depths of the ocean.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the invisible poison spikes on its veillike arms and legs, it paralyzes its enemies and causes them to drown.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It envelops its prey in its veillike arms and draws it down to the deeps, five miles below the ocean’s surface.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Legend has it that the residents of a sunken ancient city changed into these Pokémon.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
